<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-BHP Jan copper cathode output rises.</title>
<headline>RTRS-BHP Jan copper cathode output rises.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Broken Hill Pty Co Ltd, the workd's second largest copper producers, said on Tuesday it produced 38,500 tonnes of copper cathode and anode in January, up from 34,900 tonnes in December and 25,900 in January 1996.</p>
</text>
